mary energy currency, ensuring your cells have the power they need to function efficiently. </p><br><p>By supplementing with creatine, you can combat mid-day crashes and feel energized from morning to night. Research strongly suggests that creatine improves performance for sleep deprived individuals. Whether your a busy mom, on-the-go exec, or just someone that values high energy and focus, creatine can give you the lift you need.</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="eb2edf1d-4bf1-46d8-b998-cdd832017d40" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-64go3n"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/tiredperson.jpg?v=1731353451&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/tiredperson.jpg?v=1731353451&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/tiredperson.jpg?v=1731353451&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/tiredperson.jpg?v=1731353451" alt="Man resting on a couch with hand on face." class="r-10bmj24" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="8a4f155c-e39f-46b8-941d-bf4574bcdec9" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" class="r-tb441u"><div data-rid="af2c9e55-838d-4926-888a-402d82f41396" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1mj11wm"><picture data-rid="dd41fcc7-3710-45b3-9b8c-5eae2072ccaf" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-pd14m"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/womanstretching.jpg?v=1731353664&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/womanstretching.jpg?v=1731353664&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/womanstretching.jpg?v=1731353664&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/womanstretching.jpg?v=1731353664" alt="Woman using a foam roller for back exercises in a gym." class="r-1lt94oz" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="82d1c276-48dd-429a-a5d5-abb9902dd3fa" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-2zhh4r"><div data-rid="fe1b4a3f-e5b5-47df-a08b-aea4b85ee5a5" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-gskwo5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>2. Your muscles are sore and your recovery is slow</p></span></div><div data-rid="864af3f3-a228-45fd-a3be-8bcb22696bcb" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1cgl4pa alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>If your muscles constantly ache or you take longer than usual to recover after workouts, your body might be struggling to repair itself. Creatine enhances muscle hydration and repair processes, reducing soreness and inflammation. With consistent use, creatine helps you recover faster so you can get back to doing what you love—without the lingering discomfort.</p><br><p>Whether you take Create's gummies pre or post workout doesn't matter. Just keep a pouch in your gym bag or at home, so you can always access effective recovery in delicious gummy.<br><br>Of course, matching creatine with the correct training, stretching, and nutrition is essential for proper recovery. Creatine just makes it easier!</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="79738f79-45ea-48fe-80fb-b56b79b692e6" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="influencers" tabindex="-1" id="influencers" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1cz5yqu"><div data-rid="7f2d516b-00e7-4f8b-b086-fe53a35b36b6" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-16wrzli"><div data-rid="0f50397d-0941-4ec3-8e3c-146a92cadf0d" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-2sij8a alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>3. Your workouts feel flat and sluggish</p></span